(35, 'Sienna Cook', 'sienna@vettedvas.com', 'One system that runs your entire business', 'Good day,\r\n\r\nI’m Sienna with Vetted VAs. We built MAVIS (My Advanced Virtual Intelligent System), a fully integrated system that can handle both the front end and back end of your business. From prospecting, marketing, and content creation to coding, web development, operations, and admin it’s all executed inside one system.\r\n\r\nTHE BEST PART, you don’t have to learn or manage any of it. Because, every function is supported by a trained human Virtual Assistant (VA) already operating within MAVIS, ensuring everything actually gets done and not just automated.\r\n\r\nSo you are getting a full time Virtual Assistant to delegate everything to and the VA will be delegating all the day to day work to MAVIS.\r\n\r\nYou focus on scaling. We handle the execution.\r\n\r\nAre you looking for help?', '95.163.150.39', 0, '2026-05-26 17:21:46'),
(36, 'Velva Coffey', 'vc@theprofessionalprofiles.com', 'Get A Wikipedia Page For Yourself Or For Your Company.', 'Wikipedia is considered to be the World’s most significant tool for reference material. The Wiki links show up on the 1st page of Google 97% of the time. With a Page on one of the most revered reference tools, you are sure to get yourself or your business noticed. So if you\'re thinking of getting a Wikipedia Page created, it\'s the best time of the year.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in getting more information just respond back to this email.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\n\r\nVelva Coffey\r\nThe Professional Profiles\r\nvc@theprofessionalprofiles.com\r\n\r\nRespond with stop to optout.', '39.48.177.159', 0, '2026-05-26 20:55:44'),
