(47, 'Ava Williams', 'ava@virtualteamexpert.com', 'Meet the secret weapon behind successful businesses: MAVIS', 'Good day, I\'m Erin with Virtual Team Expert.\r\n\r\nI’m reaching out because we offer Virtual Assistants that utilize our custom built AI tool, MAVIS (My Advanced Virtual Intelligent System), that easily replaces a 20 man team. We overtake and handle all of your marketing, administrative tasks, graphic design, video animations, accounting and even all your prospecting with our system. This isn\'t a software you have to learn and all you have to do is delegate to a human Virtual Assistant to get everything done!\r\n\r\nAre you looking for help?', '172.93.171.214', 0, '2026-05-29 12:39:26'),
(48, 'Anthony Jackson', 'anthonyjac@parallelaid.com', 'MAVIS', 'Hi, I’m Anthony with WorkMatrixx,\r\n\r\nWe help businesses reduce operational workload by providing AI-supported human Virtual Assistants who can assist with lead generation, prospect list building, CRM management, client onboarding, appointment scheduling, inbox management, social media support, reporting, competitor research, Google Business Profile updates, and client follow-ups.\r\n\r\nOur VAs can also help organize tools like ClickUp, Asana, Trello, and Monday.com to keep projects and communication running smoothly.\r\n\r\nInstead of hiring multiple in-house staff, you work with one trained human VA backed by AI systems and our support team.\r\n\r\nWould you be open to learning more?', '172.84.124.218', 0, '2026-05-30 02:43:32'),
(49, 'Erika Clark', 'erika@trustedvirtualteam.com', 'One system that runs your entire business', 'Hi,\r\n\r\nI\'m Erika with Trusted Virtual Team.  \r\n\r\nI’m reaching out because we provide Virtual Assistants that utilize our custom built AI tool, MAVIS (My Advanced Virtual Intelligent System), that easily replaces a 20 man team. We overtake and handle your advertising, administrative tasks, graphic design, video animations, accounting and even your prospecting with our system. This isn\'t a software you have to learn and what you have to do is delegate to a Virtual Assistant to do everything!\r\n\r\nAre you looking for help?\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nErika Clark', '213.219.254.98', 0, '2026-06-01 17:59:40'),
(50, 'Charlotte Davis', 'charlotte@virtualteamexpert.com', 'One system that runs your entire business', 'Hi, I tried emailing you, but it seems it didn’t go through, so I’m reaching out here instead.\r\n\r\nI’m Charlotte from Virtual Team Expert. \r\n\r\nI’m reaching out because we offer Virtual Assistants that utilize our custom built AI tool, MAVIS (My Advanced Virtual Intelligent System), that easily replaces a 20 man team. We overtake and handle all of your marketing, administrative tasks, graphic design, video animations, accounting and even all your prospecting with our system. This isn\'t a software you have to learn and all you have to do is delegate to a human Virtual Assistant to get everything done! \r\n\r\nAre you looking for help?\r\n\r\nIf you’d like more info, just reply “yes.” If not, reply “no” and I won’t follow up.', '92.38.208.248', 0, '2026-06-01 19:22:50'),
(51, 'John Mitchell', 'john@stoneconnect.com', 'Hello from a fellow stone guy', 'Hey there!\r\n\r\nMy name is John Mitchell. I spent 20 years on the distribution side of the stone business, which means I know exactly how much time and money fabricators burn trying to find the right customers, and how much bad leads cost you.\r\n\r\nThat\'s why I built Stone Connect: a Texas-focused platform that pre-qualifies buyers by location, budget, and project type before they ever reach out to a fabricator.\r\n\r\nI\'m inviting fewer than 50 shops to test it — no cost, no obligation. Just better leads. All I ask is that I can follow up with you after the pilot to see what you thought of the experience.\r\n\r\nYou can watch my 60-second intro and learn more if you’re interested:  invitation.stoneconnect.com/?utm_source=web-form&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=pilot-outreach\r\n\r\nThanks again!\r\nJohn Mitchell\r\nFounder, Stone Connect', '73.227.173.123', 0, '2026-06-04 13:39:22'),
