(58, 'Ashley Brown', 'ashleybro@parallelaid.com', 'MAVIS', 'Good Day, I’m Ashley with WorkMatrixx,\r\n\r\nI’m reaching out because we offer Virtual Assistants that utilize our custom-built AI tool, MAVIS (My Advanced Virtual Intelligent System), that easily replaces a 20-man team. We overtake and handle all of your marketing, administrative tasks, graphic design, video animations, accounting, and even all your prospecting with our system. This isn\'t a software you have to learn, and all you have to do is delegate to a human Virtual Assistant to get everything done! \r\n\r\nAre you looking for help?', '67.219.17.185', 0, '2026-06-25 18:59:31'),
(59, 'Bhavin Thakkar', 'bhavinthakarr4@gmail.com', 'Technical Fixes to Improve Your Website Performance & SEO', 'Hi,\r\n\r\nI had a look at your website and noticed a few issues that may be affecting your business. The site doesn’t appear to be fully responsive, and the payment gateway isn’t functioning properly. I also observed that SEO and local visibility optimization haven’t been implemented yet.\r\n\r\nI understand you’ve recently started, and this is exactly the right time to fix these areas to avoid losing potential patients. I can help you resolve these issues and improve overall performance.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, I’ve created a mobile app concept tailored for your business. Would you like to see a FREE demo of your mobile app? Email me on bhavinthakarr4@gmail.com\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\n\r\nBhavin', '103.251.59.225', 0, '2026-06-26 06:58:06'),
(60, 'Jon Anderson', 'janderson.richard@gmail.com', 'Kitchen Countertop Replacement', 'Hello,\r\n\r\nWe are looking to replace our lamintate kitchen countertops with either granite or quartz. We would need a quote to include removal of existing countertops, sink cutout, possible backsplash, L-Shaped design with one stand alone cabinet. Would be interested in any remnant inventory.', '47.188.189.144', 0, '2026-06-26 13:49:48'),
(61, 'Nitin Chhabra', 'nitinchhabra0506@gmail.com', 'Kitchen countertop replacment', 'Hello, I am looking to get a quote for a kitchen countertop remodeling project in Plano. I want to buy the quartz material, fabrication, and all necessary labor bundled together.\r\n\r\nHere are the exact details of my project requirements:\r\n\r\n Total Countertop Space: Approximately 56 square feet total.\r\n\r\n Standard Counters (3 pieces):\r\n\r\n 71\" x 25.5\"\r\n\r\n 52\" x 25.5\"\r\n\r\n 39\" x 25.5\"\r\n\r\n Island Transformation (Split-Level to Flat): I currently have a two-tier raised bar top (pony wall) behind my sink that I want to completely demolish, cut down, and convert into a single-level, completely flat island.\r\n\r\n New Flat Island Dimensions: 103\" x 38\" (Since this is 38 inches deep, I will need a custom cut from a full slab to avoid a center seam).\r\n\r\n Demolition & Carpentry Labor Required:\r\n\r\n Demolish and dispose of the existing countertops.\r\n\r\n Cut down the wood studs/drywall of the 103\" raised pony wall to cabinet height, and cap it structurally so it can hold the new flat quartz.\r\n\r\n Electrical & Plumbing Labor Required:\r\n\r\n Relocate the existing electrical outlets down into the newly lowered island wall.\r\n\r\n Disconnect and reconnect the kitchen sink, fit the faucet, hook up the existing dishwasher, and reinstall the garbage disposal.\r\n\r\nCould you please provide an itemized estimate for the quartz material (Calacatta marble-look) and all fabrication, installation, carpentry, and plumbing labor included?', '2603:8083:d4f0:2270:a1dd:bdb2:be27:300f', 0, '2026-06-29 13:27:34'),
(62, 'Nicole Renovilla', 'Nicole@vettedvas.com', 'An Easier Way to Manage Your Entire Business', 'Hi, I tried emailing you, but it seems it didn’t go through, so I’m reaching out here instead.\r\n\r\nI’m Nicole from Vetted VAs. \r\n\r\nI’m reaching out because we offer Virtual Assistants that utilize our custom built AI tool, MAVIS (My Advanced Virtual Intelligent System), that easily replaces a 20 man team. We overtake and handle all of your marketing, administrative tasks, graphic design, video animations, accounting and even all your prospecting with our system. This isn\'t a software you have to learn and all you have to do is delegate to a human Virtual Assistant to get everything done! \r\n\r\nAre you looking for help?\r\n\r\nIf you’d like more info, just reply “yes.” If not, reply “no” and I won’t follow up.', '186.65.112.165', 0, '2026-06-29 21:54:18'),
