(64, 'Maria', 'customerservice@einsteinmoving.com', '512-856-5128', 'I am interested in obtaining a quote for a custom-cut marble dresser top.\r\nDimensions:\r\n\r\nWidth: 33.5\"\r\nDepth: 20\"\r\n\r\nI would appreciate any additional information regarding available marble options, pricing, lead times, and the fabrication process.\r\nPlease feel free to email me with any questions or details needed to provide an estimate.\r\nThank you, and I look forward to hearing from you.', '136.158.62.201', 0, '2026-07-09 21:13:35'),
