(95, 'Jonathan Barnes', 'jonathan.dale.barnes@gmail.com', 'Bathroom Vanity Project', 'Hi! I’m looking for a quote for quartz countertops for two bathroom vanities plus two matching shower pieces. I’m hoping to use a remnant if possible.\r\n\r\nI need:\r\n\r\nTwo vanity tops: approximately 60\" × 22\" each, with one undermount sink cutout in each\r\nOne shower piece: 64\" × 5.5\"\r\nOne shower piece: 49\" × 5.5\"\r\n\r\nWe’re looking for a white/light quartz with subtle veining. Could you send me an estimated price including the quartz, fabrication, sink cutouts, templating, and installation? Also, please let me know if you have any remnants large enough for this project.\r\n\r\nThanks!', '2600:1702:5cf0:fdf0:ecc8:4c8e:5118:76cc', 1, '2026-09-02 02:08:18'),
(96, 'MR.REMY DICKEY', 'remydickey@gmail.com', 'GRANITE COUNTERTOPS QUOTE', 'Hello,\r\n \r\nI’m emailing in regards to the order of custom granite countertops. Please email back the cost for each of the following sizes below.                                                      \r\n \r\n36” X  76” x 1 1/4”- Quantity: 5 PCs \r\n36” X 74” x 1 1/4” -Quantity: 7 PCs\r\n \r\nI would need them in either Pearl Black or Galaxy Black with only the front bull-nosed.\r\n \r\nPlease let me know how long it will take you to get these ready for pick up from your shop. Note that installation is not required, and there will be no cuts for backsplash or sinks.\r\n \r\nThank You.', '154.160.18.82', 1, '2026-09-06 23:21:00'),
(97, 'Zoe Gibson', 'zoe@rapidsweepjanitorial.com', 'Local cleaning in Plano', 'Hi,\r\n\r\nI work in Plano, and help many local companies. I was hoping I could come by and offer a complimentary cleaning bid?\r\n\r\nThank you in advance for your response.\r\n\r\nWith best,\r\n\r\nZoe Gibson\r\nBusiness Development Rep\r\nRapidSweep Janitorial\r\nzoe@rapidsweepjanitorial.com\r\n\r\nRespond with stop to optout.', '182.190.193.59', 1, '2026-09-07 23:51:02'),
(98, 'Ezra William', 'ezraseodigitalexpert@gmail.com', 'Re: SEO Report', 'Hello Good Morning,\r\n\r\nI was checking your website and see you have a good design and it looks great, but it\'s not ranking on Google and other major search engines.\r\n\r\nWith your permission I would like to send you a SEO report with prices showing you a few things to greatly improve these search results for you. These things are not difficult, and my report will be very specific. It will show you exactly what needs to be done to move you up in the rankings dramatically.\r\n\r\nKindly let me know if you would be interested so we can email you more details or schedule a call.\r\n\r\nThank you\r\nEzra William', '106.219.154.145', 0, '2026-09-09 06:02:58'),
