(110, 'Kristine Grimes', 'kristine@vettedvas.com', 'Streamline your workflow. See it work free for 30 days', 'Hi, what if you had one person you could hand everything off to?\r\n\r\nI\'m Kristine with Vetted VAS. Your trained VA runs our custom AI system for you, so admin, CRM, follow-ups and custom automations get built and done. You don\'t need new software or any training.\r\n\r\nSee it work free for 30 days.\r\n\r\nReply YES for a quick Zoom or STOP to opt out.', '173.211.50.164', 0, '2026-09-23 14:13:50');

